      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hoy, los haudenosaunee todavía llaman a esas plantas las Tres Hermanas.",
          "en": "Today, the Haudenosaunee still call those plants the Three Sisters."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se siembran juntas en el mismo montículo, y se ayudan.",
          "en": "They are planted together in one hill, and they help each other."
        },
        {
          "es": "El maíz sostiene al frijol, el frijol alimenta la tierra y la calabaza da sombra.",
          "en": "The corn holds up the beans, the beans feed the soil, and the squash shades the ground."
        },
        {
          "es": "En seneca se llaman Diohe'ko: «ellas nos sostienen».",
          "en": "In Seneca, they are called Diohe'ko: \"they sustain us.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "Una hija se volvió tres hermanas.",
          "en": "One daughter became three sisters."
        }
